  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. One of the app's five stock San Andreas color schemes -- see gta-sa-passenger-fictional's own notes for the full set and for the shared layout this reuses exactly (wordmark, month-sticker, and orange registration-detail-sticker positions), since every variant shares one base layout, just recolored and re-fonted. Black background, 'SAN ANDREAS' in bold yellow block capitals (#FDED06, sampled directly). The registration number is blank in this base texture too (filled in per-vehicle by the game), so its color is extrapolated from the wordmark color for visual consistency, not directly observed.",
